ealism. I want magic!\"]\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The final example passes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" for the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"omittingEmptySubsequences"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter, so the returned array contains empty strings where spaces"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"were repeated."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["print(line.split(separator: \" \", omittingEmptySubsequences: false)","          .map(String.init))","\/\/ Prints \"[\"BLANCHE:\", \"\", \"\", \"I\", \"don\\'t\", \"want\", \"realism.\", \"I\", \"want\", \"magic!\"]\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is the length of the sequence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/lazyfiltersequence\/iterator\/split(separator:maxsplits:omittingemptysubsequences:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/LazyFilterSequence\/Iterator\/split(separator:maxSplits:omittingEmptySubsequences:)"},"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/LazyFilterSequence/Iterator":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Iterator","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/lazyfiltersequence\/iterator","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/LazyFilterSequence\/Iterator","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Base"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityP